+++
title: Nun (mythology)
description: Ancient Egyptian personification of the primordial watery abyss
hook: Nun can be seen as the first of all the gods and the creator of reality
  — and also as the god who will destroy existence and return everything to
  the Nun whence it came. No cult was addressed to him.
standfirst: Nun is the ancient Egyptian personification of the primordial
  watery abyss which existed at the time of creation, and from which the
  creator sun god Ra arose. From the Middle Kingdom on, he is described as
  "the father of the gods" and depicted on temple walls.
